    "detailed_description": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/621010/extras/eb3d8814dff4c9cae1e5f083f391e92c.poster.avif?t=1669268011\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/621010/extras/eb3d8814dff4c9cae1e5f083f391e92c.webm?t=1669268011\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/621010/extras/eb3d8814dff4c9cae1e5f083f391e92c.mp4?t=1669268011\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><strong>&quot;The Stanley Parable/Portal of soccer VR games or something&quot; -Destructoid</strong><br><strong>&quot;While it won't win game of the year,&quot; - Common Sense Media</strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Single player story campaign with over 40 levels <br></li><li> Local Party Mode with up to 6 player pass and play<br></li><li> Actual video game (5-7 hour campaign)<br></li><li> NEW FOR PC - Practice Zone<br></li><li> NEW FOR PC - Stadium Level<br></li><li> NEW FOR PC - NO HANDS SUPPORT<br></li><li> Learn The Proper Heading Motion\u2122 from Robert<br></li><li> Head garbage bags and be a good helper<br></li><li> Be a psychiatrist<br></li><li> Head Explosive Balls (verified safe)<br></li><li> Earn a visit to The Indoor Training Zone<br></li><li> Meet Carl<br></li><li> Don't actually meet Carl<br></li><li> Beat The Keeper<br></li><li> Literally Destroy The Keeper<br></li><li> Attack A Giant Monkey<br></li><li> Head Knife Balls... carefully.<br></li><li> Head Dart Balls... also carefully.<br></li><li> Head Beach Balls without worry!<br></li><li> Decorate your Football Improvement Centre Single Occupancy Residence<br></li><li> Graduate and Return To Your Club<br></li><li> I Can't Let You Leave</li></ul><br> Available for Arcades on SpringboardVR ",
    "about_the_game": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/621010/extras/eb3d8814dff4c9cae1e5f083f391e92c.poster.avif?t=1669268011\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/621010/extras/eb3d8814dff4c9cae1e5f083f391e92c.webm?t=1669268011\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/621010/extras/eb3d8814dff4c9cae1e5f083f391e92c.mp4?t=1669268011\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><strong>&quot;The Stanley Parable/Portal of soccer VR games or something&quot; -Destructoid</strong><br><strong>&quot;While it won't win game of the year,&quot; - Common Sense Media</strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Single player story campaign with over 40 levels <br></li><li> Local Party Mode with up to 6 player pass and play<br></li><li> Actual video game (5-7 hour campaign)<br></li><li> NEW FOR PC - Practice Zone<br></li><li> NEW FOR PC - Stadium Level<br></li><li> NEW FOR PC - NO HANDS SUPPORT<br></li><li> Learn The Proper Heading Motion\u2122 from Robert<br></li><li> Head garbage bags and be a good helper<br></li><li> Be a psychiatrist<br></li><li> Head Explosive Balls (verified safe)<br></li><li> Earn a visit to The Indoor Training Zone<br></li><li> Meet Carl<br></li><li> Don't actually meet Carl<br></li><li> Beat The Keeper<br></li><li> Literally Destroy The Keeper<br></li><li> Attack A Giant Monkey<br></li><li> Head Knife Balls... carefully.<br></li><li> Head Dart Balls... also carefully.<br></li><li> Head Beach Balls without worry!<br></li><li> Decorate your Football Improvement Centre Single Occupancy Residence<br></li><li> Graduate and Return To Your Club<br></li><li> I Can't Let You Leave</li></ul><br> Available for Arcades on SpringboardVR ",
    "short_description": "Actually head virtual balls in this VR physics puzzle game. Play party mode with friends or work your way through a multi-hour campaign. Use your skills from the real world in a unique VR only experience.",
    "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support",
